#: features.js:971
msgid "Breaks start on their own so you don't overwork."
msgstr "Le pause partono da sole, così non lavori troppo."

#: features.js:975
msgid "A calm theme, no ticking seconds and no end-of-timer rush."
msgstr ""
"Un tema tranquillo, senza ticchettio dei secondi né fretta a fine timer."

#: features.js:989
msgid "The Pomodoro technique 🍅"
msgstr ""

#: features.js:991
msgid "Work in short, focused sprints with deliberate rest between them:"
msgstr ""

#: features.js:992
msgid ""
"• Focus for about 25 minutes on a single task.\n"
"• Take a 5-minute break.\n"
"• After four sprints, take a longer 15–30 minute break."
msgstr ""

#: features.js:993
msgid ""
"Why it works: a finite countdown keeps the task approachable, frequent "
"breaks protect your attention, and finishing each sprint builds momentum "
"without burnout."
msgstr ""

#: features.js:994
msgid ""
"Tip: pick one task per sprint. If something distracts you, jot it down and "
"come back to it on the break."
msgstr ""

